{
  "name": "Demo AI Meeting-to-Task",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Demo AI Meeting-to-Task (simulasi, bukan kerja klien)\n\nSebelum dijalankan:\n1. Pasang credential di node: Panggil LLM (Header Auth, nama header x-api-key), Persetujuan manusia (Gmail OAuth2), Simpan ke Sheets dan Catat log (Google Sheets).\n2. Buat 1 spreadsheet dengan 2 sheet. Sheet 'Tugas', baris 1: task, owner, due_date, priority, source_quote, needs_review, meeting_title, meeting_date. Sheet 'Log', baris 1: waktu, judul_meeting, status, jumlah_action_items, detail.\n3. Ganti GANTI_DENGAN_ID_SPREADSHEET dan GANTI_DENGAN_EMAIL_PENYETUJU.\n4. Gunakan hanya transkrip fiktif.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "7419e38e-0a47-4140-a2c1-b655414a5b6f",
      "name": "Catatan setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "5059a668-9f60-4168-a305-d5e50581c786",
        "formTitle": "Meeting ke tugas",
        "formDescription": "Tempel transkrip meeting (data fiktif) untuk diubah menjadi action items.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Judul meeting",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Tanggal meeting",
              "fieldType": "date",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Transkrip",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "87dcaaad-c1c8-4e4d-aa57-8a8b386dbca0",
      "name": "Form Transkrip",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        560
      ],
      "webhookId": "5059a668-9f60-4168-a305-d5e50581c786"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.6-flash:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-goog-api-key",
              "value": "2023-06-01"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ systemInstruction: { parts: [{ text: \"Kamu mengekstrak action items dari transkrip meeting. Balas HANYA dengan JSON valid tanpa teks lain, dengan bentuk: {\\\"summary\\\": string, \\\"action_items\\\": [{\\\"task\\\": string, \\\"owner\\\": string, \\\"due_date\\\": string, \\\"priority\\\": \\\"tinggi\\\" | \\\"sedang\\\" | \\\"rendah\\\", \\\"source_quote\\\": string, \\\"needs_review\\\": boolean}]}. Aturan: jangan menebak. Jika owner atau tenggat tidak disebut di transkrip, isi dengan \\\"tidak disebutkan\\\". source_quote adalah potongan singkat transkrip yang mendasari tugas. needs_review bernilai true jika kamu tidak yakin. Jika tidak ada tugas, action_items berupa array kosong.\" }] }, contents: [{ role: 'user', parts: [{ text: 'Judul meeting: ' + $json['Judul meeting'] + '\\nTanggal: ' + $json['Tanggal meeting'] + '\\n\\nTranskrip:\\n' + $json['Transkrip'] }] }], generationConfig: { responseMimeType: 'application/json', maxOutputTokens: 8192 } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "109b7034-9ebb-4b79-aa81-364bbb162cd1",
      "name": "Panggil LLM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        560
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 4,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const meta = $('Form Transkrip').first().json;\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  let valid = false;\n  let error = '';\n  let data = null;\n  try {\n    const cand = (item.json.candidates && item.json.candidates[0]) ? item.json.candidates[0] : null;\n    const parts = (cand && cand.content && cand.content.parts) ? cand.content.parts : [];\n    const raw = parts.map(p => p.text || '').join('');\n    const cleaned = raw.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();\n    data = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n    if (typeof data.summary !== 'string' || !Array.isArray(data.action_items)) {\n      throw new Error('Struktur JSON tidak sesuai');\n    }\n    if (data.action_items.length === 0) {\n      throw new Error('Tidak ada action item');\n    }\n    for (const a of data.action_items) {\n      if (!a.task) throw new Error('Ada action item tanpa task');\n    }\n    valid = true;\n  } catch (e) {\n    error = e.message;\n  }\n  out.push({ json: {\n    valid,\n    error,\n    meeting_title: meta['Judul meeting'],\n    meeting_date: meta['Tanggal meeting'],\n    summary: data && typeof data.summary === 'string' ? data.summary : '',\n    action_items: data && Array.isArray(data.action_items) ? data.action_items : []\n  }});\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "06eb36a8-27cc-456a-9188-f3a3177fdba7",
      "name": "Validasi hasil",
